# Claude Code's config dir inside the devcontainer (CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR).
# Local-only by default: credentials, session transcripts, caches, plugin
# checkouts, and installed_plugins.json — which records absolute install paths
# and must never be shared between checkouts.
# Two exceptions are versioned: settings.json, which declares the enabled
# plugins and permissions every checkout needs, and this project's memory —
# small, reviewable, and worth carrying between hosts.
*
!.gitignore
!/settings.json
!projects/
projects/*
!projects/-workspaces-nx_open_integrations/
projects/-workspaces-nx_open_integrations/*
!projects/-workspaces-nx_open_integrations/MEMORY.md
!projects/-workspaces-nx_open_integrations/memory/
!projects/-workspaces-nx_open_integrations/memory/**/
!projects/-workspaces-nx_open_integrations/memory/**/*.md
